error[E0320]: a borrow escapes its scope: the region `r` would occur in the result `Borrow r (Ref r Int)`
  --> tests/achc/typeck/fail/borrow_escape.hs:10:29
   |
10 | leakRef n = borrow n (\a -> pureB a)
